            { "Camera.CalculateProjectionMatrixFromPhysicalProperties", "Calculates the projection matrix from focal length, sensor size, lens shift, near plane distance, far plane distance, and Gate fit parameters.                    To calculate the projection matrix without taking Gate fit into account, use  Camera.GateFitMode. See Also: Camera.GateFitParameters" },
