            { "Rendering.RenderTargetFlags.ReadOnlyDepth", "The depth buffer bound for rendering may also bound as a samplable texture to the graphics pipeline: some platforms require the depth buffer to be set to read-only mode in such cases (D3D11, Vulkan). This flag can be used for both packed depth-stencil as well as separate depth-stencil formats." },
